    {
      "id": 17,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 48,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "title": "Investigate and recover",
      "type": "text",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**API failures:** open [Gateway and providers](/d/phaseo-gateway?var-environment=$environment&from=$__from&to=$__to) and look for shared providers, outcomes or request IDs. **Website problems:** open [Web experience](/d/phaseo-web?var-environment=$environment&from=$__from&to=$__to); browser errors and Web Vitals are in [Frontend Observability](/a/grafana-kowalski-app). **Job or settlement failures:** open [Jobs and settlement](/d/phaseo-jobs?var-environment=$environment&from=$__from&to=$__to).\n\nExpand a log, then search its `trace_id` in **Explore → Tempo**. Only 5% of backend traces are retained; a missing trace is expected for most requests. Compare the incident time with [recent deployments](https://github.com/phaseoteam/Phaseo/actions/workflows/ci.yml). After a fix or rollback, test the affected page or endpoint directly and confirm errors settle. [Alert rules](/alerting/list) show notification-rule state; this dashboard itself does not send notifications."
      }
    }
  ]
